<title>USA: Republic names former Dole CFO as new CFO.</title>
<headline>Republic names former Dole CFO as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said Tuesday that Michael Karsner has been appointed senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Before joining Republic Industries Karsner was senior vice president and chief financial officer of Dole Food Co Inc, Republic said.  </p>
<p>Karsner replaces Gregory Fairbanks, who resigned from the company in May, said company spokesman Ron Castell. Castell said Karsner's appointment begins November 1.</p>
